	1911 [label="Once more, I digress. As I said, when the time comes. And, speaking of time, it is for me to leave you now.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1911 -> 1916;
	1910 [label="While I despise admitting it, Marie and I would still be bumbling about attempting to discern how to use half the equipment in this building, while he would wield it with ease.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1910 -> 1900;
